bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]Objective:[/b] Be the first to destroy all enemy insects (20 decks).

[b]Fleet:[/b] 1×4, 2×3, 3×2, 4×1. Insects do not touch even diagonally.

[b]Moves:[/b] Hitting gives an extra turn, missing passes the turn to the AI.

[b]Radar 3×3:[/b] 1 time per game, highlights the cells with the insect, the turn does not end.

[b]Big Rock 3×3:[/b] 1 time per game, shoots at all cells in the zone, after use the turn passes to the AI.
"

